DOS utilities for C:\VMDOS (on the PATH): FreeDOS's own and a few others.
Prebuilt in bin/, so the normal build needs no extra tools; src/ holds their
source and tools/build-dosutils.sh rebuilds bin/ from it (byte for byte the
same, apart from MEM's build time). The boot floppy gets all but LESS, ZIP
and UNZIP (no room).

  Program      Version / upstream                                     Licence      Built with
  MORE.EXE     FDOS/more a071c3b (2022) + kitten, tnyprntf            GPL-2.0      Open Watcom, UPX
  FIND.EXE     FDOS/find a6e245d (2022) + kitten, tnyprntf            GPL-2.0      Open Watcom, UPX
  SORT.EXE     FDOS/sort f55bb17 (2026) + kitten, tnyprntf            GPL-2.0      Open Watcom, UPX
  MOVE.EXE     FDOS/move 44b6ad5 (2026) + kitten, tnyprntf            GPL-2.0      Open Watcom, UPX
  CHOICE.EXE   FDOS/choice fba7772 (2022) + kitten, tnyprntf          GPL-2.0      Open Watcom, UPX
  LABEL.EXE    FDOS/label 21994ae (2026) + kitten, tnyprntf           GPL-2.0      Open Watcom, UPX
